2Ki 17:1 , Hoshea's wicked reign;
2Ki 17:3 , Being subdued by Shalmaneser, he conspires against him with So, king of Egypt;
2Ki 17:5 , Samaria for sinning is led into captivity;
2Ki 17:24 , The strange nations which were transplanted into Samaria, being plagued with lions, make a mixture of religions.
